# Grupo e Personagens
<% if (it.name) { %>

## Party: <%= it.name %>

<% } %>
<% if (it.characters && it.characters.length) { %>

## Personagens do Grupo
<% for (const c of it.characters) { %>
- <%= c.name %> (<%= c.occupation %>, <%= c.healthStatus %>) — FOR <%= c.strength %>, DES <%= c.dexterity %>, CON <%= c.constitution %>, INT <%= c.intelligence %>, SAB <%= c.wisdom %>, CAR <%= c.charisma %>

<% } %>
<% } %>
<% if (it.npcs && it.npcs.length) { %>

## NPCs do Grupo
<% for (const n of it.npcs) { %>
- <%= n.name %> (<%= n.occupation %>, <%= n.healthStatus %>)
<% } %>
<% } %>
